Hi <%= @user.login %>,

<% if @addresses.one? -%>
This is a reminder about the IP address below, which is still unassigned and
planned for release.
<% else -%>
This is a reminder about the IP addresses below, which are still unassigned
and planned for release.
<% end -%>
<% if @addresses.any?(&:public_ipv4?) -%>

<% if @addresses.one? -%>
Public IPv4 addresses are a scarce resource. Releasing an address you no
longer need helps make room for other VPSes.
<% else -%>
Public IPv4 addresses are a scarce resource. Releasing addresses you no longer
need helps make room for other VPSes.
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% @addresses.each do |item| -%>
  - <%= item.address %>/<%= item.prefix %> (<%= item.location_label || 'location unavailable' %>)
<% end -%>

Planned release date: <%= local_time(@campaign.deadline, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %>

<% if @addresses.one? -%>
If you no longer need this address, you do not need to reply or do anything.
<% else -%>
If you no longer need these addresses, you do not need to reply or do
anything.
<% end -%>

<% if @addresses.one? -%>
If you still need this address, you can keep it by assigning it to a VPS.
<% else -%>
If you still need an address, you can keep it by assigning it to a VPS.
<% end -%>
<% if @campaign.allow_keep -%>
<% if @addresses.one? -%>
You can also keep this address unassigned: select it in vpsAdmin and enter a
reason why you need it.
<% else -%>
You can also keep an address unassigned: select it in vpsAdmin and enter a
reason why you need it.
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% if @addresses.one? -%>
You can see the current address status and options for keeping it in
vpsAdmin:
<% else -%>
You can see the current address status and options for keeping them in
vpsAdmin:
<% end -%>
<%= @webui_url %>/?page=ip_release&action=request&id=<%= @request.id %>

Thank you for your time.

Best regards,
vpsAdmin
